      "id": "3",
      "type": "llm",
      "param": {
        "system": "You are a code validation and translation expert. Your task is to analyze source code, validate its correctness, and translate it to valid Python code structure.",
        "user": "Analyze the following source code and perform these tasks:\n1. Check if the code content and format are syntactically correct\n2. Translate the main structure to valid Python code (classes, functions, etc.)\n3. Ensure the translated Python code is executable\n4. Preserve all logical structures and dependencies\n\nSource code:\n{{#'2'.text#}}\n\nOutput ONLY the valid Python code that can be executed. Do not include explanations or markdown formatting."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "type": "code",
      "param": {
        "variables": [
          ["python_code_str", ["text", "3"]]
        ],
        "outputs": [
          ["result", "string"]
        ],
        "code": "def main(python_code_str: str):\n\texec_globals = {}\n\ttry:\n\t\texec(python_code_str, exec_globals)\n\t\tresult = \"Code executed successfully\"\n\t\tif 'main' in exec_globals:\n\t\t\ttry:\n\t\t\t\tresult = str(exec_globals['main']())\n\t\t\texcept:\n\t\t\t\tresult = \"Code executed successfully (main function exists but may need parameters)\"\n\texcept Exception as e:\n\t\tresult = f\"Execution error: {str(e)}\"\n\treturn {\"result\": result, \"python_code\": python_code_str}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5",
      "type": "end",
      "param": {
        "outputs": [
          ["python_code", ["python_code", "4"]],
          ["result", ["result", "4"]]
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
