      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3",
      "type": "parameter-extractor",
      "param": {
        "query": ["attention", "1"],
        "parameters": [
          ["Specific contract clauses to review", "checkpoints", "array[string]"],
          ["Risk level indicators", "risk_levels", "array[string]"],
          ["Priority areas for improvement", "priorities", "array[string]"]
        ],
        "instruction": "Convert the user's specific concerns about contract risks into structured review checkpoints. Extract specific areas to examine, risk levels to assess, and priority areas for improvement based on the input: {{#'1'.attention#}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "type": "llm",
      "param": {
        "system": "You are an expert contract risk analyst specializing in {{#'1'.workfield#}} industry contracts. Your role is to conduct comprehensive risk assessments while prioritizing the interests of {{#'1'.apart#}}. You must identify potential risks, assess their impact, and provide actionable improvement suggestions.",
        "user": "Analyze the following contract text from the perspective of {{#'1'.apart#}} in the {{#'1'.workfield#}} industry.\n\nCONTRACT TEXT:\n{{#'2'.text#}}\n\nREVIEW CHECKPOINTS:\n{{#'3'.checkpoints#}}\n\nRISK LEVELS TO ASSESS:\n{{#'3'.risk_levels#}}\n\nPRIORITY AREAS:\n{{#'3'.priorities#}}\n\nPlease provide:\n1. Risk analysis for each checkpoint\n2. Specific improvement suggestions to maximize {{#'1'.apart#}}'s interests\n3. Priority ranking of suggested changes\n4. Industry-specific considerations for {{#'1'.workfield#}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5",
      "type": "template",
      "param": {
        "variables": [
          ["analysis", ["text", "4"]],
          ["party", ["apart", "1"]],
          ["field", ["workfield", "1"]],
          ["concerns", ["attention", "1"]]
        ],
        "template": "# Contract Risk Review Report\n\n## Review Overview\n- **Reviewing Party**: {{party}}\n- **Industry**: {{field}}\n- **Specific Concerns**: {{concerns}}\n\n## Executive Summary\n{{analysis}}\n\n## Recommendations Priority Matrix\nBased on the analysis above, prioritize implementing changes that provide maximum protection for {{party}} while maintaining commercial viability.\n\n---\n*This report was generated through AI-assisted contract risk analysis*"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6",
      "type": "end",
      "param": {
        "outputs": [
          ["result", ["output", "5"]]
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
